{"unit_id":"keleus__deepseek-pet#card-zh","repo":"keleus/deepseek-pet","commit":"b9b61a35c3b2443ecdeab0ed442d6b33c603d343","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Pet 是面向 Harness Web 的交互式桌宠：它作为网页浮层显示聚焦会话、并行任务和当前任务状态，并根据思考、工具执行、等待、成功、错误及上下文占用切换表情。桌宠会呈现实时回复或推理片段，点击活跃会话可切换焦点；用户还能拖动、缩放、最小化，并在设置页选择置顶模式或调整动作图片。适合希望在网页中快速查看任务进度、同时保留轻量陪伴效果的 Harness 用户。运行不需要额外 API 密钥；偏好和位置保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.jsx:13-30","src/client/DeepSeekPet.jsx:91-130","src/client/DeepSeekPet.jsx:270-323","src/client/DeepSeekPetSettings.jsx:32-82"]}
{"unit_id":"keleus__deepseek-pet#card-en","repo":"keleus/deepseek-pet","commit":"b9b61a35c3b2443ecdeab0ed442d6b33c603d343","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DeepSeek Pet is a Harness Web companion that reflects session activity with changing expressions. It shows active sessions and live output; users can focus a session, drag or resize the pet, minimize it, and customize reactions. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.jsx:13-30","src/client/DeepSeekPet.jsx:91-130","src/client/DeepSeekPet.jsx:270-323","src/client/DeepSeekPetSettings.jsx:32-82"]}
